{"w":2400,"h":3406,"lines":[{"x":0.059793812584506584,"h":0.014534883616744709,"y":0.043604651188928312,"t":"Introduction","w":0.12164948781331381,"c":1},{"x":0.063917528559533324,"c":1,"t":"MARKING THE PRACTICE TESTS","w":0.46185567220052087,"h":0.015988371754420583,"y":0.091569767451278095},{"t":"Listening and Reading","y":0.13081395376723204,"x":0.061855673920017104,"h":0.017453809100883011,"w":0.26804122924804685,"c":1},{"w":0.40206184387207022,"x":0.059793820226731451,"h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1,"t":"The Answer Keys are on pages 124-131.","y":0.15552325597902505},{"w":0.65979380289713541,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"y":0.17439812070000504,"x":0.059793820096842198,"t":"Each question in the Listening and Reading tests is worth one mark."},{"x":0.061744104366870167,"y":0.2109230264072981,"w":0.57547790527343745,"h":0.019700160673346456,"c":1,"t":"Questions which require letter \/ Roman numeral answers"},{"w":0.87227600097656255,"h":0.01813785734417428,"t":"• For questions where the answers are letters or Roman numerals, you should write only","y":0.2352071867683071,"c":1,"x":0.057673165220465138},{"w":0.84948455810546875,"c":1,"x":0.086597927040825015,"y":0.25425719305591477,"t":"the number of answers required. For example, if the answer is a single letter or numeral","h":0.017615971814445075},{"c":1,"x":0.088659784539764336,"t":"you should write only one answer. If you have written more letters or numerals than are","y":0.27325581412037447,"w":0.84123713175455739,"h":0.015988371754420694},{"t":"required, the answer must be marked wrong.","h":0.016147974163241319,"w":0.43711339314778647,"x":0.086597942489019794,"y":0.29213153283186377,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.32994186063094189,"w":0.66597935994466151,"h":0.015988371754420694,"t":"Questions which require answers in the form of words or numbers","x":0.061855680708529898},{"t":"• Answers may be written in upper or lower case.","w":0.49278350830078127,"x":0.055670101337556066,"y":0.35319767458189533,"c":1,"h":0.015988371754420583},{"c":1,"w":0.6951337178548177,"x":0.055526549235422731,"y":0.36872173017483689,"t":"• Words in brackets are optional - they are correct, but not necessary.","h":0.021170252712068294},{"x":0.055670092764235665,"y":0.38953488388640667,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1,"t":"• Alternative answers are separated by a slash (\/).","w":0.50309280395507816},{"x":0.055670104822168963,"c":1,"y":0.40839694652366698,"t":"• If you are asked to write an answer using a certain number of words and\/or (a)","w":0.79175257364908858,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"x":0.086597940666030132,"t":"number(s), you will be penalised if you exceed this. For example, if a question specifies","h":0.017615971814445075,"w":0.8453608194986979,"y":0.4271873162635631,"c":1},{"h":0.017778945403174595,"w":0.820720469156901,"y":0.44333222098420544,"x":0.086547787464601622,"c":1,"t":"an answer using NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS and the correct answer is 'black"},{"w":0.57138387044270833,"t":"leather coat', the answer 'coat of black leather' is incorrect.","x":0.084383235215721206,"y":0.46005391205220492,"h":0.021923607262316125,"c":1},{"x":0.055670091991261564,"c":1,"t":"• In questions where you are expected to complete a gap, you should only transfer the","y":0.48255813925894031,"h":0.017441861012089777,"w":0.84948455810546875},{"w":0.84329895019531231,"y":0.50000000027958857,"x":0.086597947639211748,"c":1,"t":"necessary missing word(s) onto the answer sheet. For example, to complete 'in the...',","h":0.017441859892096456},{"t":"and the correct answer is 'morning', the answer 'in the moring' would be inconect.","y":0.51879036990555349,"w":0.80412368774414067,"x":0.086597949874834698,"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1},{"y":0.53779069784087496,"t":"• All answers require correct spelling (including words in brackets).","h":0.015988371754420694,"x":0.055670101938775411,"w":0.66185567220052077,"c":1},{"w":0.77731959025065112,"y":0.55666470912577715,"c":1,"x":0.05567010167939581,"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"• Both US and UK spelling are acceptable and are included in the Answer Key."},{"y":0.57545507942557872,"w":0.7587628682454427,"h":0.017615971814445186,"t":"• All standard alternatives for numbers, dates and currencies are acceptable.","c":1,"x":0.055670112167458874},{"c":1,"x":0.055566445743908822,"y":0.59285283082693419,"h":0.017880193919765919,"t":"• All standard abbreviations are acceptable.","w":0.44145517985026039},{"h":0.017567043786040459,"t":"• You will find additional notes about individual answers in the Answer Key.","x":0.055619660877136476,"y":0.61038912732879047,"c":1,"w":0.73826431274414062},{"w":0.089962183634440113,"c":1,"x":0.057218475254291877,"h":0.018783132538540581,"y":0.64162295043124928,"t":"Writing"},{"t":"The sample answers are on pages 132-139. It is not possible for you to give yourself a mark","x":0.057731980752456592,"h":0.017615971814445186,"y":0.66852613039385433,"w":0.90103088378906249,"c":1},{"x":0.053608232635064423,"y":0.68749999972437581,"h":0.017441861012089777,"c":1,"w":0.86597941080729168,"t":"for the Writing tasks. We have provided sample answers (written by candidates), showing"},{"c":1,"y":0.70422297769973763,"w":0.86404388427734369,"h":0.019025474454260505,"t":"their score and the examiner's comments. These sample answers will give you an insight","x":0.055602859085230896},{"t":"into what is required for the Writing test.","h":0.017716264976729956,"y":0.72379692599276924,"c":1,"x":0.053503722206730234,"w":0.38784784952799478},{"y":0.95203488354680277,"c":1,"w":0.014432989756266272,"x":0.053608247303997443,"h":0.013081395479068947,"t":"8"},{"y":0.95283221925898087,"w":0.29359642028808591,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.352158555409189,"h":0.0241128134153481,"c":1}]}